// Owning domain : Identity (chora_identity database)
// Owning team   : Team 3 (Platform)
// Topic prefix  : chora.identity.agid.*
//
// AGID is the agent identity primitive — DISTINCT from GCID. Agents CANNOT
// hold TenantMembership. AGIDs are issued for:
//   - CHORA_INTERNAL_CREW : platform-owned crews (per Tier 5 D20)
//   - EXTERNAL_PARTNER    : external partner agents onboarded via A2A gateway
//   - BYOA                : Bring-Your-Own-Agent tenant-scoped agents
//
// When an agent emits a domain event, the AGID is carried in
// envelope.gcid (per envelope semantics — the actor identifier slot).
// Downstream consumers determine "is this an agent or a user?" by looking
// up the identifier in chora_identity (GCID table vs AGID table).
//
// EVERY event message embeds chora.common.v1.EventEnvelope as field 1.
// =============================================================================

